<title>USA: Packaging Research names new CEO.</title>
<headline>Packaging Research names new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging Research Co said Monday it has named Timothy Phillips chief executive.</p>
<p>Phillips has been serving as president since August 23.</p>
<p>Packaging Research is a manufacturer and distributor of precision high-speed food processing equipment and a holding company of pasta sauce manufacturer Mama Rizzo's Inc.</p>
